  _shortDescription: "553,3 metrelik CN Kulesi, bir d\xF6nem d\xFCnyan\u0131n en
    y\xFCksek ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z yap\u0131s\u0131yd\u0131. Cam zeminli seyir
    alanlar\u0131 ve d\u0131\u015Far\u0131da yap\u0131lan EdgeWalk deneyimi, Toronto
    manzaras\u0131na g\xFC\xE7l\xFC bir y\xFCkseklik hissi katar. 1976\u2019da a\xE7\u0131lan
    kule asl\u0131nda ileti\u015Fim sinyallerini \u015Fehrin h\u0131zla y\xFCkselen
    g\xF6kdelenlerinin \xFCzerinden iletmek i\xE7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131."
